BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.42 Tm (Hold a forty-five-minute weekly portfolio meeting using a frozen servicer export, bank activity, underlying) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.20 Tm (statements, and the task register. The founder chairs until the operations lead exists. Measure collection) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (effectiveness as scheduled borrower cash received by the contractual due date divided by scheduled cash) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (due, reporting principal, interest, and escrow separately. Do not call that ratio operator revenue. Show) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (thirty-day delinquency by unpaid principal balance and by account count; one large troubled note can hide) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (inside an attractive count-based statistic. Track the percentage of senior payments independently verified) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (before their applicable deadline, with a target of one hundred percent. Also show open escrow shortfalls,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (insurance cancellations, unresolved suspense balances, and days since each exception was first identified.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (A late senior payment requires immediate action even when the wrap buyer paid on time. Track RMLO) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (package first-pass acceptance and counsel deadline adherence, but never reward speed by overlooking) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (missing income evidence. End the meeting with a named owner, funded remediation, and next review date) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (for every material exception. Preserve each weekly snapshot so a prospective buyer can distinguish stable) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (controls from a clean dashboard assembled immediately before marketing the business.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (Set a maximum twenty-five percent economic exposure to any related borrower group, seller source, referral) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (channel, or funding counterparty. Calculate each relevant concentration on both trailing-twelve-month) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (operator contribution and the associated portfolio exposure: outstanding wrap principal for borrower groups,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (acquisition contribution for seller channels, and callable obligations for funding providers. Do not mix these) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (denominators into one flattering percentage. Underlying lender concentration also matters because similar) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (transfer terms or acceleration practices can create correlated stress. Separate ultimate ownership groups) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (rather than counting multiple entities as independent customers. At twenty percent, require a written) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (diversification plan; at twenty-five percent, stop adding exposure to that group. A new book with fewer than) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (four independent accounts cannot satisfy a universal twenty-five percent account cap. Label that book) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (concentrated incubation inventory, fund its stress reserve, and do not market it as diversified. One RMLO) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm (and one servicer create deliberate vendor dependencies in the four-seat architecture. Disclose those) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 237.02 Tm (one-hundred-percent service dependencies separately instead of claiming the economic cap eliminates) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 221.80 Tm (them. Reduce outage risk through portable exports, successor-provider diligence, and contractually) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 206.57 Tm (specified transition assistance. Activating simultaneous additional provider seats changes the stated pod) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 191.35 Tm (model and must be counted.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 176.12 Tm (Tie scorecard consequences to control failures rather than subjective frustration. If an RMLO package fails) Tj ET
